quired before changing layout.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/g5/listing-a.txt\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/g5/listing-b.txt\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Codex pre-arm runs had no advisor because the arena is untrusted: hooks need per-entry approval stored in ~/.codex/config.toml, no arena project entry exists, and 0 of 6 raw transcripts contain Advisor:.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".codex/config.toml\\\",\\\".codex/README.md\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\\\",\\\"~/.codex/config.toml\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The scorer cannot attribute a start to the brief: raw Claude transcripts contain Advisor: 6 of 6 while normalized records contain it 0 of 6, Pi is 6 of 6 in-prompt, and OpenCode 1 of 6, so offered-versus-declined is unmeasurable without a hook-recorded brief.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\\\",\\\".skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/index.mjs\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter002-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The pre-arm log grew between iterations from 24/24/24/13/10/10 to 24/24/24/15/13/11 rows per runtime, so any summary number is a snapshot and a before/after comparison needs an arm-completeness guard.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-pre.jsonl\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/tasks.md\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Codex declined the command\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Codex never received a brief in the arena because project hooks were unapproved; 0 of 6 raw transcripts contain Advisor:.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"A COMMAND line proves the model saw an offer\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"DSH emitted two COMMAND tokens in six sampled sessions with its prompt-advisor row disabled.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli/deltas/iter-002.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794524525573,"end":1794524536685}}}}
